Ordemio is a powerful and FREE AI Chatbot plugin for WordPress, powered by ChatGPT and your custom data.

== Description ==

Ordemio is a powerful and FREE AI Chatbot plugin for WordPress, powered by ChatGPT and your custom data. Embed it seamlessly on your website, WhatsApp, or Instagram and let it provide human-like responses 24/7. Boost sales, enhance lead generation, and streamline customer support with a custom AI chatbot tailored to your business needs.

With easy setup and management through your WordPress dashboard and [Ordemio](https://www.ordemio.com/ai-chatbot?utm_source=wp-plugin&utm_medium=wp_directory&utm_campaign=plugin_description), you can quickly build and adjust your chatbot, customize its appearance, control data, view conversations, and much more—no coding required! Ordemio’s free plan includes 100 messages per month, with premium options starting at just $19/month for additional features and enhanced capabilities.

### Why Choose Ordemio

🗨️ **Resolve 80% of Support Inquiries**: Leverage ChatGPT-4 and your data to provide secure, precise answers, reducing customer wait times and your team’s workload.

🚀 **Capture More Leads & Drive Sales**: Collect leads and engage customers with a personalized experience. Use your chatbot to distribute coupons, qualify leads, and schedule appointments effortlessly.

🤖 **Deliver Cross-Platform & Multilingual Support**: Connect with customers in their native language and on their preferred platform—whether it’s your website, WhatsApp, Instagram, Slack, or Discord.

### Key Features

Discover Ordemio’s powerful features, designed to take your customer service from ordinary to extraordinary.

– **Multiple Data Sources**: Import data from over 25 sources to train and sync your chatbot.
– **95+ Language Support**: Communicate in your customers’ preferred languages, even when your data is in a different language.
– **Detailed Analytics**: Gain insights into user behavior with conversation quality analysis, advanced AI summaries, and topic categorization.
– **Integrations with Popular Tools**: Compatible with a range of platforms and tools to streamline operations.
– **Website & Sitemap Crawling**: Enrich your chatbot’s knowledge base using URLs and sitemaps from external sources.
– **Automated Lead Collection**: Capture and categorize leads automatically, making follow-up easier than ever.
– **Chat History Access**: Review full chat logs to refine and enhance user interactions.
– **Engaging Suggested Questions**: Prompt user engagement with predefined starter questions.
– **Full Appearance Customization**: Match your chatbot’s design to your brand’s unique style and colors.
– **Priority Support**: Access premium support for quick issue resolution and enhanced peace of mind.

