== Installation ==

#### Automatic Installation

To install Ordemio’s AI Chatbot plugin, follow these steps:

1. Go to your WordPress Dashboard > Plugins.
2. Click **Add New** and search for "Ordemio AI ChatBot".
3. Click **Install** and then **Activate** to enable the plugin.

== External services ==

This plugin connects to the Ordemio API to interact with your account on ordemio.com.
It is required for synchronizing the settings of your AI assistant with your WordPress site, including selecting and transferring the knowledge base for training the assistant.
This service is provided by https://ordemio.com : [Terms of use](https://www.ordemio.com/terms) , [Privacy Policy](https://www.ordemio.com/privacy)
== Frequently Asked Questions ==

= **Is Ordemio free?** =
Yes! The Ordemio plugin for WordPress is FREE and includes 100 messages per month. For advanced features and greater message limits, you can upgrade to one of our affordable plans.

= **Can I use external data (files, YouTube, etc.)?** =
Absolutely! Ordemio supports data from websites, PDFs, DOCs, YouTube, JSON, Notion, Zendesk, and more. Your AI chatbot will always stay synced with your data.

= **Do I need coding skills to use Ordemio?** =
No coding is required! Ordemio’s AI chatbot plugin is designed to be managed entirely from your WordPress dashboard, making it user-friendly for everyone.

